# Files outside any package that must ship in the sdist + wheel.
#
# LICENSE is required at runtime by security/origin_attestation.py
# verify_brand_markers() - without it, every Nunba boot logs
# "Origin attestation FAILED: Missing required file: LICENSE"
# at WARNING level until attestation degrades silently.
#
# README.md is included for the wheel's long-description path.
include LICENSE
include README.md
